  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management of Documentation and Mobility of Officials, Specialists and Other Actors in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project identifies the needs and manages issues related to organizing travel, the associated documentation and overall facilitation for the mobilization of various actors involved in issues of Human Rights and International Humanitarian Law. Activities include cooperation and migration, assistance to cases with special requirements, and documentation needs. It seeks to provide timely guidance on travel documentation requirements and establish good practices in migration processes associated with the mobilization of the population referred to by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
